# Python-Specific Standards

## Language & Tools
- Primary language is Python (≥3.10)
- Secondary: SQL/KQL, Bash/Zsh, some Zig/C
- Use uv for dependency management as configured in [pyproject.toml](mdc:pyproject.toml)

## Code Quality
- Use Ruff for formatting and linting
- Add type hints and keep them compatible with mypy/pyright
- Prefer standard library or existing dependencies
- Don't add new dependencies for trivial tasks

## Project Structure
- Follow src/ layout as shown in [src/](mdc:src/)
- Respect [pyproject.toml](mdc:pyproject.toml) as single source of truth
- Use [Makefile](mdc:Makefile) targets for all build/QA operations